   "originalText": "! 36 of 54 matrix runs are invalid: java and python were measured at 0 replicas (harness/exp3_matrix.py:118-121) \u2014 0 bookings, 100% timeouts in results/exp3/runs.csv\n! The committed chart is the synthetic test fixture (figures/exp3_duplicates.svg = figures/tests/fixtures/exp3_summary_synthetic.csv)\n! summary.csv predates the matrix and mixes a TOTAL=500 smoke run; re-running make summary today would report 0 duplicates for java and python naive at 5%\nBDD: no .feature files; the 8 pytest contract tests are the acceptance layer (partial coverage)",
